      {
        "affiliation": "Hitachi Denshi, Kodaira, Tokyo 187, Japan",
        "bio": "Toshiaki Kawamura received his B.S.E.E. degree from Kyushu Institute of Technology in 1958. He has been engaged in developing and designing of VTRs for broadcasting use. Currently he is a deputy general manager of Koganei Works, Hitachi Denshi.",
        "name": "Toshiaki Kawamura"
      }
